ret.','Enable Content Shortcodes?'=>'Skal indholdskortkoder aktiveres?','If you send out notifications with BNFW but don\'t receive them, you may need to install an SMTP plugin to <a href="https://betternotificationsforwp.com/documentation/getting-started/how-to-improve-email-delivery/" target="_blank">improve email deliverability</a>. I recommend using <a href="https://wordpress.org/plugins/post-smtp/" target="_blank">Post SMTP</a> as it\'s easy to set-up or <a href="https://wordpress.org/plugins/email-log/" target="_blank">Email Log</a> to just log and view emails that are sent.'=>'Hvis du sender meddelelser med BNFW, men ikke modtager dem, skal du muligvis installere et SMTP-plugin for at <a href="https://betternotificationsforwp.com/documentation/getting-started/how-to-improve-email-delivery/" target="_blank">forbedre e-mail-levering .</a> Jeg anbefaler at bruge <a href="https://wordpress.org/plugins/post-smtp/" target="_blank">Post SMTP,</a> da det er nemt at konfigurere eller <a href="https://wordpress.org/plugins/email-log/" target="_blank">e-mail log</a> til bare at logge og se e-mails, der sendes.','. Shortcodes will not be replaced with content.'=>'. Kortkoder erstattes ikke med indhold.','here'=>'her','This will send you (the currently logged in user) a notification so that you can check for any issues with formatting – it’s doesn\'t mean that a notification will send correctly in the future. You can read about how to improve email delivery'=>'Dette sender dig (den bruger, der aktuelt er logget på), en meddelelse, så du kan kontrollere, om der er problemer med formateringen – det betyder ikke, at en meddelelse sendes korrekt i fremtiden. Du kan læse om, hvordan du forbedrer e-mail-levering','Use this to enable or disable notifications. If you want to disable a default WordPress notification, just create it on the left, then disable it here.'=>'Brug denne indstilling til at aktivere eller deaktivere beskeder. Hvis du vil deaktivere en WordPress-standardmed